 75SE c  Dataset for unplaced |g rays. See a separate dataset for               
 75SE2c  a level scheme from (n,|g)                                             
 75SE c  1984To11,1982ToZS: both references (1982ToZT is a thesis) are from     
 75SE2c  the same lab; measured |g, ce; enriched target. Curved-crystal         
 75SE3c  spectrometers were used for |g rays below 2 MeV and pair spectrometer  
 75SE4c  was used for |g rays above 2 MeV.                                      
 75SE c  1981En07: three-crystal-pair spectrometer was used, measured primary   
 75SE2c  and secondary |g rays                                                  
 75SE c  2007ChZX: PGAA-database. In measurements of elemental cross sections   
 75SE2c  at Budapest, 18 secondary and 2 primary gamma rays were identified     
 75SE3c  for {+75}Se. These are listed under document records                   
 75SE c  Others: 1984NeZR, 1983Ah01, 1973Ak02, 1970Ru06, 1967Dr03               
